  "details": "I had multiple Quest users say they don't have any poor or better avatars, I always tell them to pick a random very poor one, and it's almost always poor or better on PC, there needs to be a way for them to know\n\nClarification: Add easy multi platform performance ranking that can be seen from your avatar list, on avatar thumbnail. Adding the ability to sort by performance for a specific platform and not just your own.",
